# C = complete source MACRO extent under the stated criterion, P = partial,
# N = not demonstrated. These are neither anatomical accuracy measurements nor
# proof of the same feature on another person. Related BP/Z meshes are NOT two
# independent specimens. Every side of each paired bone was inspected separately.
